observer/static — asset provenance
==================================

D9(a), Fable addendum 10.

No raster asset is used by this viewer.

`upstream/assets/flycoin.png` and `upstream/assets/flycoin_square.png` are
token imagery and are **out of scope**: the launch layer never enters Flytrade
code or docs.

`upstream/site/web/fly.png` was **not** used. It is 704 KB, above the 200 KB
ceiling addendum 10 sets for any raster added in this wave, and using it would
have meant committing a resized derivative rather than the licensed file.

The fly-and-circuit figure on the watch screen is therefore an original
schematic authored in this wave: inline SVG in `observer/index.html`, drawn
from the populations the run actually records (ORN drive, Kenyon cells, the
two decoder MBON populations and their modulatory partners). It carries the
word SCHEMATIC visibly. It is a diagram, not an anatomical rendering, and it
claims no coordinates.

